so the Governor can sleep well.

1013
01:10:41.167 --> 01:10:44.250
Sankaran Nair is defending a rapist.

1014
01:10:46.042 --> 01:10:48.250
From today, this should be
the only thing

1015
01:10:49.875 --> 01:10:51.417
