1036
01:14:56.042 --> 01:14:58.000
Mr. Nair, please begin.

1037
01:14:58.125 --> 01:14:59.208
Your Honour,

1038
01:14:59.333 --> 01:15:01.708
I request that Dilreet Gill

1039
01:15:01.917 --> 01:15:03.333
